n formative assessment, and its related areas of feedback practices and assessment design, would have much to recommend for classroom and assessment practice. But it is less clear which practices in particular are minimally required in order for formative assessment to succeed. This paper attempts to identify the minimal requirements for formative assessment to succeed in terms of assessment standards, assessment design, and assessment feedback.",
