ntioned the four types of formative assessment namely self-assessment, peer assessment, teacher assessment and collaborative assessment. Besides, Black and Wiliam (1998) emphasized that formative assessment activities were tools to provide feedback for teachers and students to modify teaching and learning activities they took part in. In this study, the researcher tries to explore just two types of the formative assessment called peer-assessment and self-assessment.",
