r analyses. For enrollment, credit accumulation, and degree completion, data are available for nearly every student in the study, if the relevant information (e.g., transcript records for credit accumulation) was collected for that study. 13 When the college or NSC data include no records for a given student, we treat that student as not being enrolled, and therefore earning zero credits and not earning a degree.",
